<p> Burdekin	8,387,903    383,179  1,859,978   14.36    13.57</p>
<p> Central Qld  11,411,900    516,947  2,394,636   13.36    12.72</p>
<p> South Qld     5,425,000    187,309    650,225   12.97    12.69</p>
<p> Queensland   37,929,903  1,623,359  6,811,751   13.15    12.72</p>
