<p>NOTE: 1996 Summary - Total cane crushed 39.604 million tonnes (Qld 37.217 million, NSW 2.387 million), sugar produced 5.442 million tonnes 94 nt, (Qld 5.156 million, NSW 285,616), sugar content (CCS) 13.50 percent (Qld 13.62 percent, NSW 11.63 percent).  </p>
